OL,3,GNEWSABattery fire on plane was so fast,
OL,4,Apassenger says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plane passenger has described her
OL,7,Ffright as a traveller's battery pack in
OL,8,Fthe row in front of her burst into
OL,9,Fflames during a flight.
OL,11,FSisters Sandy Edwards and Jackie Riggs,
OL,12,Ffrom Portslade and Pevensey Bay in East
OL,13,FSussex, were on board the British
OL,14,FAirways (BA) flight from Gatwick
OL,15,FAirport to Italy before it was forced
OL,16,Fto turn back on 15 October.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
