OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABattery fire on plane was so fast,
OL,4,Apassenger says
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdwards told BBC Radio Sussex it "all
OL,7,Fhappened so fast": "The gentleman in
OL,8,Ffront of us started screaming and I
OL,9,Fthought he was having a panic attack,
OL,10,Fbut then he stood up and his tracksuit
OL,11,Fwas on fire."
OL,13,FA BA spokesperson said: "We're
OL,14,Fextremely grateful for the actions of
OL,15,Four crew on the flight to resolve the
OL,16,Fissue swiftly and safely."
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
